o1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7__DwauOvnMZ_Qd6r2zmXRB7LgR69SUSrFx2Ty5A4MeA&oe=6A09B08C"}, "display_name": "Twisted Dark", "keywords": ["comic", "book", "horror", "experience", "story"], "long_description": "Enter Twisted Dark, an immersive VR comic reading experience built around one core promise: a huge amount of story content delivered inside interactive 3D worlds.\n\nRead the complete 8-volume Twisted Dark collection in Twisted Mode. Each volume is presented in a custom 3D scene designed to pull you into the atmosphere of the book. Explore and interact with Twisted Objects hidden throughout the environment. Find them to trigger a chilling reveal: the scene \u201cbreaks,\u201d shifting into its creepy Twisted version.\n\nPrefer a linear narrative? Switch to Story Mode, a curated experience with three additional books, the stories of Amy, Mike, and Candice presented in chronological order for a clearer, character-driven journey through the Twisted Dark universe.\n\nWant to stay grounded in your space? Use Passthrough Mode and bring Twisted Dark into your real environment while you read.\n\nFeatures\n\nAll 8 Twisted Dark volumes included (Twisted Mode)\n\nUnique 3D scene per volume with special interactions\n\nTwisted Objects to discover uncover the unsettling Twisted version of each scene on the Twisted Mode\n\nStory Mode with 3 extra books: Amy, Mike, and Candice in chronological order\n\nPassthrough Mode for reading in your real space\n\nDesigned for immersive, comfortable comic reading in VR\n\nIf you want an atmospheric, content-rich experience that blends reading with exploration and discovery, Twisted Dark delivers the definitive way to enter the story.", "short_description": "Every volume hides something. Read all 8 Twisted Dark books in custom made environments from the stories, uncover Twisted Objects, and watch the world shift into its misterious Twisted version."}]}, "developer_name": "OceanRoot Productions", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "ht